---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: not paused
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_saft: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale ended
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_verify_saft --> q_verify_sig: verify SAFT signature
    q_verify_saft --> q_revert_saft: invalid SAFT signature
    q_revert_saft --> [*]: revert InvalidSAFTSignature
    q_verify_sig --> q_transfer: valid Legion signer authorization
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_position --> q_cache: position.investedCapital += amount
    q_cache --> q_update_total: cache investAmount and tokenAllocationRate from SAFT
    q_update_total --> [*]: totalCapitalInvested += amount, emit Invested

    note right of q_verify_saft
        INV-001: SAFT signature required - encodes token allocation rate per investor
        INV-002: cachedTokenAllocationRate determines tokens per capital unit
        INV-003: investment possible until sale manually ended
        INV-004: each investment updates cached allocation parameters
    end note
